flowchart LR
    A[Alert] --> B[Automated enrichment:<br/>IP/hash/geo/asset/user lookup]
    B --> C[Case created]
    C --> D{Sensitive action?<br/>Disable exec account or<br/>isolate critical server}
    D -->|Yes| E[Stage action +<br/>require human approval]
    E --> F{Approved?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Execute action]
    F -->|No| H[Action rejected/closed]
    D -->|No| I[Execute automatically]
